---
/**
 * A build note for the committee — where a file goes, what still needs a
 * decision. Rendered only under `astro dev`. A production build emits nothing
 * here at all, so neither the wording nor the src/content/ paths it mentions
 * reach a visitor.
 *
 * Anything a visitor should read — an empty state, a caveat about how names
 * are linked — is not a Todo. Use <aside class="note"> for that; it ships.
 */
---

{import.meta.env.DEV && (
  <aside class="todo">
    <slot />
  </aside>
)}
